WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
No suitable direct train?

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Compare a connecting journey, but check the whole trip.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Read the date on each leg, the interchange station…

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
…and the waiting time.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
Then check seats and fares for both trains.

6
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.500
RailQ’s planner helps you compare timetable routes;

7
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.000
it does not reserve tickets or guarantee the connection.

8
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[On screen] Keep a workable backup.

